  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building Support on Extractives to Network Movement for Justice and Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This fund is intended to support the technical capacity of the Net Work Movement for Justice and Development (NMJD) to take a lead role in Natural Resource Governance and Economic Justice Network in Sierra Leone (NaRGEJ-SL). The support will enable the Executive Director of NMJD to participate in training on &#x201c;Extractive Industries and Sustainable Development&#x201d;, offered by the Vale Columbia Centre on Sustainable International Investment (VCC) and the Centre on Globalization and Sustainable Development (CGSD) at Columbia University, New York, USA from June 10, 2013 to June 21, 2013.</narrative>
  </description>
